    "body": "The latter.\r\n\r\nCustom elements allows you to implement subclasses of HTMLElement, and the goal is to give you the same powers as other subclasses. No other subclasses have that power; it's a special superglobal implemented for all HTML elements, but not part of any specific element's code. As such, we don't give that power to user-defined subclasses, just like we don't give it to browser-defined ones.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
