    "updated_at": "2017-09-12T22:46:04Z",
    "body": "That seems pretty specious? Why are you privileging the superglobal attribute there?  What's special about it such that we don't think we need to provide the same capability to authors?\r\n\r\nWhether an property is defined on a superclass or subclass is an implementation detail, not a meaningful capability difference.",
